Installation:

    git clone git://github.com/fcapovilla/dotvim.git ~/.vim

Create symlinks:

    ln -s ~/.vim/vimrc ~/.vimrc
    ln -s ~/.vim/gvimrc ~/.gvimrc

Install CoC dependencies with asdf

    wget https://github.com/asdf-vm/asdf/releases/download/v0.19.0/asdf-v0.19.0-linux-amd64.tar.gz
    tar xzvf asdf-v0.19.0-linux-amd64.tar.gz
    rm asdf-v0.19.0-linux-amd64.tar.gz
    mkdir bin
    mv asdf bin
    echo 'export PATH="${ASDF_DATA_DIR:-$HOME/.asdf}/shims:$PATH"' >> ~/.bashrc
    echo 'export PATH="${ASDF_DATA_DIR:-$HOME/.asdf}/shims:$PATH"' >> ~/.zshrc
    asdf plugin add nodejs
    asdf install nodejs 20.19.0
    asdf global nodejs 20.19.0
    npm install --global yarn

For copy-paste support in Wayland, install `wl-clipboard`.

Open Vim and Install plugins

    :PlugInstall
